    {
      "id": "KrMSIsVfsP4FgEspJTq2L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 69.24444749620227,
      "y": 8708.522264268664,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bjI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 887431268,
      "version": 208,
      "versionNonce": 1578502959,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775873697397,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这是一个线程调度执行的过程！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这是一个线程调度执行的过程！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "C-VzUWvjKl-XbRLxGwaTl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 867.199951171875,
      "y": 7628.800079345703,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bjJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1801001700,
      "version": 492,
      "versionNonce": 1620565476,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775800424873,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 怎么做到让线程不做任何切换，如果我可以做到在我线程执行某种代码的时候可以把时钟\n中断或者相关中断关掉，那不就会一直跑了嘛，过段时间再打开，OS不就可以继续调度了\n嘛，在这两个之间的时候线程执行就没人打扰了，这个不就是原子性嘛，这个打开关闭的过\n程不也就是加锁和解锁嘛",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 怎么做到让线程不做任何切换，如果我可以做到在我线程执行某种代码的时候可以把时钟中断或者相关中断关掉，那不就会一直跑了嘛，过段时间再打开，OS不就可以继续调度了嘛，在这两个之间的时候线程执行就没人打扰了，这个不就是原子性嘛，这个打开关闭的过程不也就是加锁和解锁嘛",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "m7zUFnfe5cS1SG9k8bqo0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 658.8445909288195,
      "y": 8534.922288682727,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bjK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1344455140,
      "version": 335,
      "versionNonce": 1688915279,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775873697397,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "内存数据，往往要被多线程共享的！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "内存数据，往往要被多线程共享的！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vpXkCsh6La6P-XNOEoKSt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 49.16340806749133,
      "y": 8777.54446750217,
      "width": 781.1399536132812,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bjL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1238220380,
      "version": 275,
      "versionNonce": 1387823457,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "88GXs225294eMYIFXbByQ",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1775873691456,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CPU内寄存器只有一套，寄存器的内容本质：当前线程的硬件上下文！每个线程都有自己\n独占的栈结构上下文。所以我们用一条汇编将内存数据和CPU里面的寄存器内容做交换，\n本质是什么？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CPU内寄存器只有一套，寄存器的内容本质：当前线程的硬件上下文！每个线程都有自己独占的栈结构上下文。所以我们用一条汇编将内存数据和CPU里面的寄存器内容做交换，本质是什么？",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8oS0tubCAgpJ2xtU81lou",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1090.5777994791667,
      "y": 8896.433342827691,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bjM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1371071844,
      "version": 303,
      "versionNonce": 1848826305,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "sbFPI7ZDi2kzl6nIu8hZa",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1775873812708,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "本质不就是把一个共享的数据内容，变成一个线程私有的内容！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "本质不就是把一个共享的数据内容，变成一个线程私有的内容！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vX8kL-bi1OE3IJh3-IZh-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 891.7335679796007,
      "y": 8787.144443088107,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bjN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1857917660,
      "version": 408,
      "versionNonce": 1916689697,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "88GXs225294eMYIFXbByQ",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "sbFPI7ZDi2kzl6nIu8hZa",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1775873691456,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这就意味着我一旦交换变成线程私有的之后，就是我一个人拥有了，意味着其他线程再想得\n到这个1，是不可能得到的。除非我归还！！！这个\"1\"就是锁，那个线程拥有这个1就拥有\n这个锁。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这就意味着我一旦交换变成线程私有的之后，就是我一个人拥有了，意味着其他线程再想得到这个1，是不可能得到的。除非我归还！！！这个\"1\"就是锁，那个线程拥有这个1就拥有这个锁。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
